abstract: "Code for the main analyses and figures of the paper (Parkinson's Precision Medicine Initiative cohort): cohort construction and longitudinal mixed-effects models, the bifactor measurement model of global cognition, fMRIPrep/XCP-D preprocessing submission with run selection, the Network-Based Statistic with residualised-regressor permutation inference, the connectivity-to-outcome analyses and the scripts that draw Figures 1 to 5. No participant-level data are included."
